<title>ZIMBABWE: PRESS DIGEST - Zimbabwe - April 15.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Zimbabwe - April 15.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in Zimbabwe's state-owned Herald newspaper on Tuesday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>THE HERALD</p>
<p>- Eight people, three from the same family, were killed and 32 injured in road accidents throughout Zimbabwe at the weekend.</p>
<p>- Eleven people believed to be behind a sex syndicate involving homeless street children were arrested in Harare at the weekend.</p>
<p>-- Harare Newsroom: +263-4 72 52 28/9.</p>
